`Γ'_{φ(k)}` has the integer slice property (`Submission.cbr_ci_dilation_slice_property`), the
masses `M_W(Γ'_{φ(k)}) + M_W(∂Γ'_{φ(k)}) ≤ μ'_{φ(k)}(closure W)` are bounded (each is finite and
